<title>USA: Clorox to consolidate Armor All.</title>
<headline>Clorox to consolidate Armor All.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, Calif. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Clorox Co said it will begin on March 31 to consolidate the operations of Armor All Products at its Oakland headquarters and technical center in Pleasanton, Calif.</p>
<p>In December, Clorox purchased Armor All in a tender offer.</p>
<p>As a result of the consolidation, Clorox said, 106 Armor All employees will lose their current jobs. Of those, about 20 to 30 will be reasigned to other jobs within Clorox. The others will be laid off as the consolidation progresses, Clorox said.</p>
</text>
